    "turn_text": "Yeah, and no. I don't think Vice President is president. I think sitting behind that desk and having the buck stop with him is very different. And I think he fills out the job very well. Better than I expected, not to say I wasn't excited about his election. I was excited about his election. But to say that, again, comparing it to his predecessors, he has a dimension they didn't have. He has the experience, exposure to Congress, and he has the foreign policy file, which they did not have. All four of them, I'm talking about Clinton, Bush, 43, Obama, and Trump.",
