  {
    "episode_id": 91042,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91042.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 63,
    "turn_text": "Well, maybe, maybe not. I mean, we haven't covered our expenses in this country for a long time. Our debt is ballooning. Our interest rates are going up, something your clients obviously are experiencing. And the cost of goods is going up, something I am experiencing. And so we have to have a strategy, part of this strategy for paying for programs going forward. And this is not a one-off, this infrastructure plus social programs. I mean, behind it comes a lot of other stuff that we want to get done. And so I I think, and I think the Biden team is capable of doing this. We have to put more pieces on the puzzle board. And part one of them is getting closer to a more responsible budget, not just a more responsible infrastructure",
